@startuml FoodRescue_Food_Listing_Lifecycle

title FoodRescue — Food Listing Lifecycle

[*] --> Draft : Listing created

Draft --> Available : Valid listing submitted

Available --> Requested : Valid request received
Available --> Cancelled : Donor cancels
Available --> Expired : Expiry time reached

Requested --> Allocated : Request approved\nand allocation created
Requested --> Expired : Expiry time reached
Requested --> Cancelled : Listing cancelled

Allocated --> "Pickup Pending" : Pickup coordination begins
Allocated --> Cancelled : Allocation cancelled

"Pickup Pending" --> Collected : Pickup confirmed
"Pickup Pending" --> Expired : Expiry time reached
"Pickup Pending" --> Cancelled : Allocation cancelled

Collected --> Delivered : Delivery confirmed

Delivered --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

@enduml